{"path":"container/queue/emplace","title":"std::queue<T,Container>::emplace","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::queue&lt;T,Container&gt;::</span>emplace","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/queue/emplace","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Pushes a new element to the end of the queue. The element is constructed in-place, i.e. no copy or move operations are performed.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev\">\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx17\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Args</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> emplace<span class=\"br0\">(</span> Args<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">args</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx17\">(until C++17)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Args</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> emplace<span class=\"br0\">(</span> Args<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">args</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Pushes a new element to the end of the queue. The element is constructed in-place, i.e. no copy or move operations are performed. The constructor of the element is called with exactly the same arguments as supplied to the function.\n</p><p>Effectively calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c.<span class=\"me1\">emplace_back</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Args<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args<span class=\"br0\">)</span>...<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> args\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> arguments to forward to the constructor of the element\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-until-cxx17\"><td>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx17\">(until C++17)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx17\"><td>\n<p>The value or reference, if any, returned by the above call to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Container<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">emplace_back</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Identical to the complexity of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Container<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">emplace_back</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;queue&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> S\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> id<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    S<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> d, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> id<span class=\"br0\">{</span>i<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"S::S(\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> d <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", <span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>);<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/queue\"><span class=\"kw1306\">std::<span class=\"me2\">queue</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>S<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> queue<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> S<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> queue.<span class=\"me1\">emplace</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">42</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">3.14</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"C++\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// for return value C++17 required</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"id = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">id</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>S::S(42, 3.14, \"C++\")\nid = 42</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue2783\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 2783</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++17\n</td>\n<td><code>emplace</code> returned <code>reference</code>, breaking compatibility with pre-C++17 containers\n</td>\n<td>returns <code>decltype(auto)</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/queue/push\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>push</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts element at the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/queue/pop\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>pop</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  removes the first element <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/queue","title":"std::queue"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::queue<T,Container>::emplace","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11, until C++17, since C++17. Pushes a new element to the end of the queue."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"args"},{"label":"Return value"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Identical to the complexity of Container::emplace_back."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"push","note":"inserts element at the end"},{"label":"pop","note":"removes the first element"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17"],"wordCount":232,"codeBlockCount":2}
